<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.disibio.vid-archiver-gui</id>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>Apache-2.0</project_license>

  <name>Vid Archiver GUI</name>
  <summary>Download with yt-dlp and file everything into the right folder</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.disibio">
    <name>disibio</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Vid Archiver GUI is a desktop front end for yt-dlp, the open-source media downloader. Paste links, choose a
      preset and click Start; there's no command line.
    </p>
    <p>
      Folder rules pick the destination folder from the site, channel, playlist, title or any other field yt-dlp
      reports, so every download is filed into the right place automatically.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Presets are plain yt-dlp options: paste the command you already use</li>
      <li>Queue many links and run several downloads at once</li>
      <li>Automatic retries, and a gentle mode that paces requests for large archive jobs</li>
      <li>Keeps yt-dlp up to date, with one-click rollback</li>
      <li>Light and dark themes</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      On first start the app downloads yt-dlp from its official releases and checks it against the published
      checksums. Please respect copyright and each site's terms of service.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.disibio.vid-archiver-gui.desktop</launchable>

